am/apps/2982610/extras/526edd3d9b637d979ea9721de7c30a79.poster.avif?t=1785482689\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982610/extras/526edd3d9b637d979ea9721de7c30a79.webm?t=1785482689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982610/extras/526edd3d9b637d979ea9721de7c30a79.mp4?t=1785482689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and unlock all of the armour transformations and their unique abilities in a <strong>dark action-adventure <i>soulslike</i></strong>, where the shield can truly change the outcome of every encounter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secret of the chess pieces and guide Zefiro through <strong>Medhelan</strong> on an <strong>epic quest to return to Heaven.</strong></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 ryzen 5 PRO 3350G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA  GeForce® GTX 1650 SUPER™<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Be not afraid. (Update your graphic card drivers)</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Crossfall Games"],"publishers":["Crossfall Games"],"release_date":"26 May, 2026"}